2d:["$","$L3d",null,{"title":"README â•± THE CONTENT ARCHITECTURE","subTitle":"A PERSONAL NOTE FROM THE MAINTAINER","legend":[{"id":"why-this-exists","label":"001 / WHY THIS EXISTS"},{"id":"why-i-keep-shipping-it","label":"002 / WHY I KEEP SHIPPING IT"},{"id":"who-am-i","label":"003 / WHO AM I"}],"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col gap-48 divide-y divide-black/20","children":[["$","section","3bfff7eac590",{"id":"why-this-exists","className":"flex flex-col gap-16 pb-64 last:pb-0","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-mono text-caption-20 uppercase","children":["$","$L30",null,{"children":["001"," / ","WHY THIS EXISTS"]}]}],["$","$L30",null,{"animationDelay":0.1,"as":"div","splitSelector":"[data-text]","className":"flex w-full flex-col gap-[1em] [&_[data-text]>*:not(:first-child)]:indent-0 text-body-10","children":[["$","div","54234a0f01d0",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["Every Sanity project I shipped, the first week looked identical. Spin up Next, or Astro. Wire the Studio. Rewrite the page builder. Rebuild the SEO layer. Re-do the webhook revalidation. Re-style the same contact form for the fourth time."]}],["$","div","1c4daa95e370",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["By the time the actual creative work started, 3 days of the budget were gone and the client had not seen a single pixel that mattered."]}],["$","div","345406dc12c7",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["Extracting it started small. One project. Then two. Then ten. Every time something broke in production, a Sanity migration that nuked a dataset, a CDN cache that served stale OG images for three weeks, a webhook that fired twice and corrupted a sitemap, the fix went back into the boilerplate."]}],["$","div","183eeb7d77f0",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["For a long time I called this the cost of headless. I had rebuilt the same foundation so many times I could do it half-asleep, and I mistook that for being good at my job instead of what it was, doing the same work twice."]}],["$","div","344eebfdad4b",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["At some point that stopped being a reason to keep it to myself."]}],["$","div","dbbbb2fcd4c5",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["If you want the reasoning before you buy, I wrote it all down: ",["$","$L3e","b333c7a58069",{"href":"https://www.edoardolunardi.dev/blog/the-content-architecture-cms-structure","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"underline decoration-from-font decoration-dashed underline-offset-3","children":["CMS structure"]}],", ",["$","$L3e","f09817f2ea8b",{"href":"https://www.edoardolunardi.dev/blog/the-content-architecture-content-models","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"underline decoration-from-font decoration-dashed underline-offset-3","children":["content models"]}],", ",["$","$L3e","7fdefc30d790",{"href":"https://www.edoardolunardi.dev/blog/the-content-architecture-page-composition","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"underline decoration-from-font decoration-dashed underline-offset-3","children":["page composition"]}],", and ",["$","$L3e","7330fd13d590",{"href":"https://www.edoardolunardi.dev/blog/the-content-architecture-content-primitives","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"underline decoration-from-font decoration-dashed underline-offset-3","children":["content primitives"]}],". The thinking behind every decision in the codebase, free to read."]}]]}]]}],["$","section","6672c06c97d3",{"id":"why-i-keep-shipping-it","className":"flex flex-col gap-16 pb-64 last:pb-0","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-mono text-caption-20 uppercase","children":["$","$L30",null,{"children":["002"," / ","WHY I KEEP SHIPPING IT"]}]}],"$L3f"]}],"$L40"]}]}]
