3a:["$","div","196d245fac05",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["These terms are governed by Austrian law. If any clause is found unenforceable, the rest remains in effect. Questions go to ",["$","$L3e","b986d6624599",{"href":"mailto:hello@edoardolunardi.dev","className":"underline decoration-from-font decoration-dashed underline-offset-3","children":["hello@edoardolunardi.dev"]}],"."]}]
3f:["$","$L30",null,{"animationDelay":0.1,"as":"div","splitSelector":"[data-text]","className":"flex w-full flex-col gap-[1em] [&_[data-text]>*:not(:first-child)]:indent-0 text-body-10","children":[["$","div","70d2fdd58bc8",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["I use this on every project. I am the heaviest user. The bug I find on a Friday client engagement is the patch you get on Monday."]}],["$","div","abb4e9ff6dae",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["I am one person, not a team. That is a feature. The architecture is consistent because one mind held it from the first schema file to the last revalidation hook. Nobody overrode the opinion. Nobody added a field because a stakeholder asked nicely."]}],["$","div","connbeat01",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["There is no distance between me and this. The decisions in the repo are the ones I make on paid work, in the same week, under the same deadline. When you open the fetch layer or the page builder, you are reading how I actually ship, not a demo cleaned up for sale. That is the whole relationship: you get the thing I rely on, maintained by the person who relies on it most."]}],["$","div","e0caa421f1df",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["I am not trying to turn this into a SaaS. There is no dashboard, no seat-based pricing, no telemetry. The roadmap is not fixed in stone either, it grows out of real client work: when a project turns up something worth having, it becomes part of the product. You buy the repo, you own the repo. I maintain it because I use it too."]}],["$","div","abed4fe4badb",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["Maintaining this in public is a forcing function for my own work. With paying users on both repos, I cannot let the schema rot, skip a Next.js or Astro major, or sit on a breaking change in a Sanity plugin. The same discipline is why an agent is useful on it: the calls are already made and written down, so it builds inside them instead of guessing. Your projects stay current because mine have to."]}]]}]
40:["$","section","e26317c308c6",{"id":"who-am-i","className":"flex flex-col gap-16 pb-64 last:pb-0","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-mono text-caption-20 uppercase","children":["$","$L30",null,{"children":["003"," / ","WHO AM I"]}]}],["$","$L30",null,{"animationDelay":0.1,"as":"div","splitSelector":"[data-text]","className":"flex w-full flex-col gap-[1em] [&_[data-text]>*:not(:first-child)]:indent-0 text-body-10","children":[["$","div","90536670937d",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"children":["I am Edo ",["$","$L4b","5960a7c36d4d",{"image":{"_id":"image-db451abc27a16f698305dcb56ec920d5a9dc08c8-1566x1566-jpg","_rev":"fWX29cmQ00AYAU8uIyf37j","altText":"Man in black turtleneck smiling and looking to the side indoors","crop":null,"description":null,"dimensions":{"_type":"sanity.imageDimensions","aspectRatio":1,"height":1566,"width":1566},"hotspot":null,"lqip":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","title":null},"aspectRatio":1,"width":100,"className":"inline-flex h-[1em] w-auto translate-y-[-0.1em] align-middle"}]," - Creative Web Engineer, nearly a decade in. Sanity Pioneer 2026, Awwwards jury member, recognized across Awwwards, CSSDA, and FWA. I have shipped for Buck, Disney, Porsche, Red Bull, Le Labo Fragrances, Getty. Design sensibility, technical depth, obsessive about detail. Based in Vienna, working worldwide."]}],["$","figure","505246234a4e",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-16","data-rich-text-block":"mediaBlock","children":[["$","$L4c",null,{"video":{"_id":"558f8bea-d862-4b32-ad6c-4484e63e645e","_rev":"a5LeVtXGopd0TFR4TufkxV","dimensions":{"aspectRatio":1.7777777777777777,"height":2160,"width":3840},"duration":78.476,"playbackId":"GEAvJNkNURFGORLe01pSIREO7Egh7TtACZclFBXQ9LoE","thumbTime":1},"animatedThumbnail":{"enabled":false,"end":5,"start":0},"loop":true,"autoPlay":true,"aspectRatio":1.7777777777777777,"className":"rounded-8","muted":true,"noControls":false}],null]}],["$","div","9db9e9e72a96",{"className":"empty:h-[1lh]","data-text":true,"chi